      "content": "ok so if i'm worried about memory i guess i should be careful. but the warning itself feels kind of... aggressive? like it's trying to alert me to something hidden. is there any way to actually \"silence\" it or does that just hide the issue? also is there a specific way to use .loc to avoid it instead of just copying everything?",
